# System Components

Humare paas

```
Coordinator
```

Aur

```
Participants
```

Example

```
          Coordinator

         /     |      \

      DB1     DB2     DB3
```

Coordinator boss hai.

Participants workers.

Coordinator decision leta hai.

Participants follow karte hain.

