# Biggest Problems of 2PC 😭

---

# 1. Single Point Of Failure

Coordinator mar gaya

System ruk gaya.

```
Coordinator

❌

↓

Everyone Waiting
```

---

# 2. Blocking Protocol

Participants

```
Rows Locked
```

Aur wait karte rehte hain.

Meanwhile

Dusri transactions

```
Blocked
```

---

Real Example

Restaurant

Ek table reserve hai.

Customer nahi aa raha.

Restaurant wait hi karta rahega.

Dusra customer baith nahi sakta.

---

# 3. Lock Contention

Suppose

```
Balance Row Locked
```

Dusra transaction

```
Withdraw
```

Cannot proceed.

Sab line me khade.

---

# 4. Poor Performance

Normal transaction

```
1 Network Call
```

2PC

```
Prepare

↓

Reply

↓

Commit

↓

Ack
```

Bahut network trips.

Latency increase.

---

# 5. Recovery Complex

Crash hua.

Logs recover karo.

Decision recover karo.

Coordinator recover karo.

Sab synchronize karo.

Complex.

---

