# Advantages ✅

✔ Strong Atomicity

✔ ACID across databases

✔ No partial commit

✔ Data consistency maintained

✔ Widely understood protocol

---

# Disadvantages ❌

❌ Slow

❌ Blocking

❌ Locks held for long time

❌ Coordinator failure dangerous

❌ High latency

❌ Doesn't scale well

---

# Why Modern Systems Avoid 2PC?

Google

Amazon

Netflix

Uber

Meta

Mostly avoid cross-partition transactions.

Instead they use

```
Saga Pattern

Outbox Pattern

Event Driven Architecture

Compensation Transactions

Eventual Consistency
```

Reason

Scalability > Strict Consistency (for many workloads)

