# Interview Questions 🎤

## Q1. Why not simply commit one database first?

Because agar second fail ho gaya

Atomicity break ho jayegi.

---

## Q2. Why prepare phase?

Taaki sab participants guarantee de saken

```
I CAN COMMIT
```

before actual commit.

---

## Q3. Why lock rows?

Taaki koi dusra transaction beech me data modify na kare.

---

## Q4. Why is 2PC blocking?

Participants prepare ke baad coordinator ke decision ka wait karte hain aur locks hold karte rehte hain.

---

## Q5. Why coordinator log maintain karta hai?

Crash recovery ke liye.

---

## Q6. Why isn't 2PC highly scalable?

- Extra network round trips
- Long-lived locks
- Coordinator bottleneck
- Blocking on failures

